# KnowledgeForge API Rules for Claude

## 🚀 Mandatory Regression Check
- **ALWAYS** run `make quick-check` from the root after modifying API or extraction logic.
- Ensure all 11 E2E tests in `test_e2e_extraction.py` pass.

## 🐍 Python & FastAPI Standards
- Use Python 3.11+, Pydantic V2, and strict type hints.
- Logic for C4 extraction belongs in `app/services/c4/`.
- Metadata extraction (Domain, Owner, Tier, etc.) must handle missing data gracefully but log extensively.
- Git history extraction requires `full_history=True` in `github_downloader.py`.

## 📦 Data Models
- Use Pydantic models for all API responses.
- JSON serialization must handle complex types (dictionaries/lists) correctly for the UI.

## 🧪 Testing
- All new extraction logic must have a corresponding test case in `test_e2e_extraction.py`.
